        "title": "Every day, millions of tons of food are wasted all over the world. Why do you think this is happening? And how can we solve this problem?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQWMdU1QYoo0sKxAGQIlV2aFgbe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GPoAdf3BkoJlVPxAvTElaIxpgme\"><em><strong>Every day, millions of tons of food are wasted all over the world. Why do you think this is happening? And how can we solve this problem?</strong></em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Food Waste: Causes &amp; Solutions <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tu0SddWcDoz931xKri8lpq8Wgxh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề <em>Food Waste: Causes &amp; Solutions&nbsp;</em>cho 1 xu hướng:&nbsp;</strong>Mỗi ng&agrave;y, h&agrave;ng triệu tấn thực phẩm bị l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n thế giới.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ct2UdtYdhoby7Nxrd2SlZFGAgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Trả lời 2 c&acirc;u hỏi trực tiếp:&nbsp;<em>Tại sao điều n&agrave;y xảy ra? Ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể giải quyết vấn đề n&agrave;y như thế n&agrave;o?</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRaBdsLuZoP0rUxH5FWly8vXgUb\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i&nbsp;<em>Food Waste: Causes &amp; Solutions</em>&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RvxLdkWg2o1TemxUMSJlS50eguh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TS3PdFFE4ooFjlx0jselldGTgEe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O66RdEdiuoAwdBxsDMPlxpn0gCd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">discarded <em>(bị vứt bỏ)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RQSlddEvOoG6VVxAXT3lJrsjg38\" data-list=\"bullet\">on a daily basis<em> (mỗi ng&agrave;y)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sukddc77loPsMxxLtyKlkqdYgFb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C7yrdcTO5oqFcXxj2eulMHpUgdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JsabdjYrpoeNLgx2I7glvIXKgfe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, đối với dạng c&oacute; <strong>hai c&acirc;u hỏi độc lập</strong>, th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ lần lượt trả lời từng c&acirc;u hỏi trong mỗi BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NHondlQHQoSvFwxo2qRljImZgOe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n dẫn đến việc l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; thực phẩm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W3xqd9C33ot9ZExvD6el2ifBgnd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Đề xuất giải ph&aacute;p để giải quyết những vấn đề ph&aacute;t sinh từ xu hướng n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y v&agrave; ph&acirc;n t&iacute;ch c&aacute;c nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n dẫn đến việc l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; thực phẩm.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoD7dJ6YFoa0rLxlxj1l11v0gwo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F5tQdQOeaoe8mMxQ5UklAxSJgNh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WhKydTGIuoxZ05xYIxWlZPqbgTh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span><em>Th&oacute;i quen ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng (consumer habits)</em> v&agrave; <em>c&aacute;ch vận h&agrave;nh của doanh nghiệp (business practices)</em> l&agrave; những nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n ch&iacute;nh dẫn đến vấn đề nghi&ecirc;m trọng n&agrave;y</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7iId6hhwoyuHZxjXJ5l19sfgKd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAgHdsdjDohJbvxNORLlgQBqg7c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea: </strong>Về ph&iacute;a người ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng, việc <em>kh&ocirc;ng l&ecirc;n kế hoạch bữa ăn (poor meal planning)</em> khiến nhiều người mua nhiều thực phẩm hơn mức cần thiết</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZexDdV8ppoE82kxisQPlQ71Ag0e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Nguy&ecirc;n nh&acirc;n l&agrave; do họ thường <em>c&oacute; t&acirc;m l&yacute; \"th&agrave; dư c&ograve;n hơn thiếu\" (adopt a \"better to have more than not enough\" mentality)</em> khi đi mua sắm, đồng thời dễ bị thu h&uacute;t bởi c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh khuyến m&atilde;i như giảm gi&aacute; hay <em>mua một tặng một (buy-one-get-one-free deals)</em>, khiến họ mua vượt qu&aacute; nhu cầu thực tế. Hậu quả l&agrave; phần lớn đồ ăn<em> dư thừa (surplus food) bị hỏng (spoils) </em>trước khi kịp sử dụng<em> </em>v&agrave; cuối c&ugrave;ng bị vứt v&agrave;o th&ugrave;ng r&aacute;c</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XrwCd0yJMo0jNUxFNvNlWLcfg1e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vs9bdaafkoRCYVxqvhOlBBh7gLe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea: </strong>Về ph&iacute;a doanh nghiệp, c&aacute;c si&ecirc;u thị thường loại bỏ <em>những sản phẩm c&oacute; h&igrave;nh d&aacute;ng kh&ocirc;ng ho&agrave;n hảo (imperfect-looking products)</em> để đ&aacute;p ứng kỳ vọng của kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZXVdOwYboLow7xjqDRlYMmVgBc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Hầu hết người ti&ecirc;u d&ugrave;ng thường <em>g&aacute;n những sản phẩm bắt mắt với sự tươi ngon v&agrave; chất lượng tốt hơn (associate visually appealing produce with freshness and better quality)</em>, n&ecirc;n họ ưu ti&ecirc;n chọn những m&oacute;n n&agrave;y thay v&igrave; những tr&aacute;i c&acirc;y, rau củ <em>m&eacute;o m&oacute; (oddly-shaped)</em>. Do đ&oacute;, c&aacute;c nh&agrave; b&aacute;n lẻ loại bỏ những sản phẩm kh&ocirc;ng ho&agrave;n hảo n&agrave;y, thải một lượng lớn <em>thực phẩm vẫn c&ograve;n ăn được (perfectly edible produce)</em> ra b&atilde;i r&aacute;c</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Đề xuất giải ph&aacute;p để giải quyết những vấn đề đ&atilde; n&ecirc;u ở phần BODY 1.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjagdHbLyoowjwxYEW4l2Quigug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IMDNd3MH4oKzDpxutSSl4mMegvh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sw7Nd7yYpoSL3kxZzWXl77tKgdX\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence:&nbsp;</strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, c&oacute; một số giải ph&aacute;p thiết thực để giải quyết những vấn đề n&agrave;y</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PhRSdel6LoOHtWxhOaHllMpKg9d\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I0XddwQJBoLl6YxsgWvlneqvgue\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea:&nbsp;</strong>Thứ nhất, ch&iacute;nh phủ v&agrave; c&aacute;c tổ chức n&ecirc;n ph&aacute;t động c&aacute;c chiến dịch truyền th&ocirc;ng để n&acirc;ng cao nhận thức của người d&acirc;n về t&aacute;c hại của việc l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; thực phẩm đối với m&ocirc;i trường</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T7izdK6wjo64yOxA6F6lS0Y6gLb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Khi mọi người hiểu được th&oacute;i quen của họ g&oacute;p phần g&acirc;y ra vấn đề n&agrave;y như thế n&agrave;o, họ sẽ c&oacute; xu hướng l&ecirc;n kế hoạch bữa ăn cẩn thận hơn v&agrave; <em>tr&aacute;nh mua sắm theo cảm t&iacute;nh (avoid impulsive purchases)</em>, điều n&agrave;y kh&ocirc;ng chỉ c&oacute; lợi cho m&ocirc;i trường m&agrave; c&ograve;n gi&uacute;p họ tiết kiệm tiền về l&acirc;u d&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKdBd2jDColbB2xUgeJl0rQMgNe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RzLPd2a0toBjxZx1fA6luq2ngfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core Idea: </strong>Thứ hai, c&aacute;c si&ecirc;u thị v&agrave; nh&agrave; h&agrave;ng n&ecirc;n <em>xem x&eacute;t lại c&aacute;ch xử l&yacute; thực phẩm dư thừa v&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng ho&agrave;n hảo (reconsider how they handle surplus and imperfect food)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hd3ldFRaAorGEMxmvTjlZLZ3gCh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:&nbsp;</strong>Thay v&igrave; vứt bỏ những sản phẩm n&agrave;y, họ c&oacute; thể quy&ecirc;n g&oacute;p cho c&aacute;c tổ chức từ thiện để hỗ trợ <em>những cộng đồng kh&oacute; khăn (disadvantaged communities)</em>, hoặc b&aacute;n rau củ quả m&eacute;o m&oacute; với gi&aacute; thấp hơn để thu h&uacute;t <em>những kh&aacute;ch h&agrave;ng quan t&acirc;m đến gi&aacute; cả (attract budget-conscious shoppers)</em>. Cả hai c&aacute;ch tiếp cận n&agrave;y đều gi&uacute;p giảm đ&aacute;ng kể lượng thực phẩm l&atilde;ng ph&iacute;, đồng thời mang đến những lựa chọn với gi&aacute; cả phải chăng cho c&aacute;c gia đ&igrave;nh thu nhập thấp v&agrave; g&oacute;p phần&nbsp;<em>giảm thiểu nạn đ&oacute;i (alleviate hunger)</em> đối những người đang cần gi&uacute;p đỡ</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOh0dpvFwodYoYxAfXPlC5RmgbG\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YUnRdmwHoomd0bx3B9xl3s1Agte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YvCFdQxWsoceFLxYDv4lsxKqg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt lại ngắn gọn c&aacute;c &yacute; đ&atilde; được thảo luận trong 2 đoạn BODY nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2nCdFhyUoQul9xqlgXlr4PKgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">food waste&nbsp;<em>(sự l&atilde;ng ph&iacute; lương thực)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ee4Jdw1TOosZpRxGDvJlAJHVgyb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">the rejection of imperfect products <em>(việc từ chối b&aacute;n những sản phẩm m&eacute;o m&oacute;)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3185,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>It has been observed that a significant amount of food is discarded on a daily basis around the world. This alarming issue can be attributed to several factors, and timely measures must be taken to address it effectively.</p>",
            "question_id": 41784,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3186,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HFuXdVBXfotzPvx4x42l76fYg8f\"><strong>Consumer habits and business practices are the primary causes of this growing problem.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">Regarding the former, poor meal planning leads many people to purchase more food than they actually need. This is because consumers often adopt a \"better to have more than not enough\" mentality while also being attracted by promotions such as discounts or buy-one-get-one-free deals, leading them to buy beyond their actual needs. As a result, much of this surplus food spoils before it can be consumed and eventually ends up in the trash.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">As for the latter, supermarkets often discard imperfect-looking products to meet customer expectations. Most consumers associate visually appealing produce with freshness and better quality, making them favor such items over oddly-shaped ones. Consequently, retailers reject these imperfect fruits and vegetables, sending a large amount of perfectly edible produce to landfills.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 41784,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3187,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UxjIdksZ5oviCUxNgT7lEQdxgne\"><strong>However, there are several practical solutions to tackle these issues.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">First, governments and organizations should launch education campaigns to raise public awareness about the environmental consequences of wasting food. Once people understand how their habits contribute to this problem, they are more likely to plan their meals carefully and avoid impulsive purchases, which not only benefits the environment but also helps them save money in the long run. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Second, supermarkets and restaurants should reconsider how they handle surplus and imperfect food. Rather than throwing these items away, they could donate them to charities to support disadvantaged communities, or offer oddly-shaped produce at lower prices to attract budget-conscious shoppers. Both approaches would significantly reduce food waste while providing affordable options for low-income families and helping to alleviate hunger among those in need.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 41784,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3188,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<p>In conclusion, food waste is largely caused by poor consumer planning and the rejection of imperfect products by supermarkets. To address this issue, raising awareness through education and encouraging businesses to donate or discount surplus food are essential steps forward.</p>",
